+## HTTPS
+
+Set `server.protocol` to `https` and provide an existing TLS certificate and matching private key. Flipt serves the REST API, UI, and gRPC endpoint over TLS with these files. Startup fails if either path is empty or the file does not exist.
+
+```yaml
+server:
+  protocol: https
+  https_port: 8443
+  grpc_port: 9000
+  cert_file: /etc/flipt/tls/cert.pem
+  cert_key: /etc/flipt/tls/key.pem
+```
+
+The default `http` protocol keeps existing HTTP configurations working. `http_port` and `https_port` are separate settings; Flipt uses the port for the selected protocol.
+
 ## Databases
 
 Flipt supports both [SQLite](https://www.sqlite.org/index.html) and [Postgres](https://www.postgresql.org/) databases as of `v0.5.0`.
